{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41407","headline":"奉和圣制元日大雪登楼 · 张义方","name":"奉和圣制元日大雪登楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恰当岁日纷纷落，天宝瑶花助物华。\n自古最先标瑞牒，有谁轻拟比杨花。\n密飘粉署光同冷，静压青松势欲斜。\n岂但小臣添兴咏，狂歌醉舞一家家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张义方","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}